    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Exceptionally spacious three bedroom semi-detached home situated at this popular development on the outskirts of Kilmacthomas town, a short walk to the Kilmacthomas town centre, schools, GAA Club, and The Waterford Greenway. This property will immediately impress once viewed with its spacious accommodation, front and rear gardens, and off street parking for at least two vehicles. The property is nicely situated on a corner site adjacent to a large communal green area. Spacious accommodation includes, entrance hall, sitting room, kitchen/dining room, utility room, wc, three bedrooms, one en-suite and main bathroom. This house will suit a range of potential purchasers, and provides a blank canvass to decorate to ones own personal taste.\r\n\r\nViewing Strictly by Appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor:\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall ;\t\t\t19ft.3\" × 7ft.5\".            (5.9m. × 2.3m.)                    \r\n\r\nCeramic floor tiles, solid timber stairway, centre lighting.\r\n      \r\nSitting Room ;  \t\t\t14ft. 1\" × 13ft. 8\"     \t(4.3m. × 4.2m.)            \r\n\r\nOpen fireplace with marble inset, marble surround and marble hearth, laminate flooring, centre lighting, TV point.\r\n\r\nKitchen/dining room ;\t\t15ft.10\" × 13ft.4\".      (4.6m. × 4.1m.)\r\n          \r\nFitted kitchen with breakfast counter, cooker, extractor fan, ceramic tiled backsplash, ceramic floor tiles, double doors to rear garden, centre lighting.\r\n                            \r\nUtility Room ;\t\t\t8ft.5\"× 4ft. 3\"            (2.6m. × 1.3m.)         \r\n\r\nCeramic floor tiles, plumbed for washing machine/dryer, centre light, door to side of property.\r\n\r\nDownstairs toilet:\t\t\t4ft.9\" × 4ft.3\".          (1.5m. × 1.3m.)\r\n\r\nWc, whb., ceramic tiled floor, centre light.                                                                                                                  \r\n\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\n\r\nLanding:\t\t\t            11ft.1\" × 8ft.2\"        (3.4m. × 2.5m.)\r\n\r\nCarpet floor covering, centre lighting, smoke alarm.\r\n\r\nHot press:\r\n\r\nImmersion heater, shelving and storage.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:\t                                    12ft.1\" × 11ft.8\"       (3.7m. × 3.6m.)            \r\n\r\nLaminate flooring, centre lighting, TV point.\r\n\r\nEn-suite:\t\t         \t            7ft.5\" × 4ft.6”          (2.3m. × 1.4m.)\r\n\r\nWc., whb., corner shower unit with Triton T90si fitted, ceramic floor and wall tiles, centre light, extractor fan. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\t\t        \t            13ft. 8\" × 9ft.8\"       (4.2m. × 3m.)\r\n\r\nLaminate flooring, centre lighting, TV point.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3;\t\t\t             9ft.8\" × 8ft.3\"     (3m. × 2.5m.)\r\n\r\nLaminate flooring, centre lighting, TV point.\r\n       \r\nMain Bathroom:\t\t             9ft.8\" × 7ft. 8\"    (3m. × 2.4m.)\r\n\r\nWc., whb., bath, ceramic floor tiles, centre light."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Outside:\r\n\r\n•\tFont garden with parking for two vehicles, maintenance free.\r\n•\tRear garden with side access from the front of the house.\r\n•\tGarden access from the house by double doors from the Kitchen/dining area..\r\n•\tGreen amenity/leisure area to the front of the house.\r\n\t\t\r\nIncluded :\r\n\r\n•\tLight fittings.\r\n•\tFloor coverings.\r\n•\tFixtures and fittings.                                                                                           \r\n\r\nGeneral features;\r\n\r\n•\tThree bedroom semi-detached home.\r\n•\tSituated on the outskirts of Kilmacthomas town, five minutes walk.\r\n•\tWalking distance to schools.\r\n•\tClose access to N25 Waterford/Cork road.\r\n•\tWaterford City 20 minutes drive.\r\n•\tDungarvan town 15 minutes drive.\r\n•\tClose access to Waterford Greenway.\r\n•\tOil fired central heating.\r\n•\tPVC double glazed windows.\r\n•\tPVC facia and soffit.\r\n•\tAdjacent to a large green area.\r\n•\tExcellent location…..close to schools and all amenities."
      },
